{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Summoner\u2019s Cookbook</i></strong><i> is</i>\u00a0a blend of crafting, alchemy, riddle solving and idle automation. Experiment with arcane ingredients, decipher written incantations, build and set up a summoning assembly line to fulfill increasingly complex requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an aspiring summoner, you\u2019ll gather ingredients, perform rituals, and conjure creatures demons and spirits. Build equipment, enhance your summoning circles, and summon minions and put them to work to automate your operation for mass production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forage, buy or refine ingredients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover over 100 recipes by deciphering written clues and incantations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on delivery requests for gold, rewards and prestige</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and build to expand your operation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate, summon minions to work for you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563820?t=1745935469","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563820?t=1745935469","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/6cdcd538f02eb09d200abb2711c178d29566958e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745935469","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/6cdcd538f02eb09d200abb2711c178d29566958e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745935469","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"de